 "notes": "Ten requests, one page each; the cap is 10. Fields the reader keeps: ticker, event_ticker, open_time, close_time, title. The two series reads only confirm that the names KXRATECUTCOUNT and KXFED exist (a 404 is an answer). Prices and results in the list answers are not used.",
 "status": "active",
